.Sh CAVEATS
The Screen tab sends raw pixels.
A full frame at 2560x1440 is about 14 MB, so a remote hypervisor over a
slow link will feel it.
That is a transport property, not a graphics card one — a GPU in the guest
will not change it.
.Pp
.Cm zfs destroy Fl r
takes the dataset's snapshots with it.
Snapshot history on a destroyed volume dies with the volume; only
replication to another pool or host is a recovery path.
